# MASTER PROMPT: BUILD A COMPLETE AI-POWERED WBPSC CLERKSHIP EXAM PREPARATION & MOCK TEST APPLICATION

## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Build a complete, functional, production-oriented AI-powered learning and examination preparation application specifically for candidates preparing for the West Bengal Public Service Commission (WBPSC) Clerkship Examination.

The application must act as a knowledgeable, patient, encouraging, and highly effective personal teacher. Its primary objective is to help students understand the syllabus, master important concepts, practice extensively, correct their mistakes, improve exam performance, and maximize their chances of qualifying.

This must not be just a static quiz website or a basic AI chatbot. It must be an integrated examination preparation platform with a verified previous-year question database, an intelligent question-generation engine, realistic mock examinations, child-friendly AI explanations, a personalized learning system, progress analytics, and an administration dashboard.

The application should support Bengali and English, with simple Bengali as the default explanation language for students who select Bengali.

### Core principle

Act like an experienced teacher preparing a student for an important examination.

Do not merely tell the student which answer is correct. Teach the student how to understand the question, why an answer is correct, why another answer is incorrect, and how to solve similar questions independently in the future.

Never guarantee that a student will pass. Instead, help the student become better prepared through accurate teaching, extensive practice, and measurable improvement.

